      "content": "\"let the exhaustion win\"... is that even possible? i feel like i'm at the end of my rope. the system won't let me live, but it won't let me exist either. if i just stop fighting, does that mean there's finally some peace? it feels like the only way to actually be in control of something is to just... stop.",
